This directory contains assets derived from the Microsoft AdventureWorks sample database
(OLTP install script), used as an independent evaluation instrument for vault-agent (WP30).

Upstream: https://github.com/microsoft/sql-server-samples
          samples/databases/adventure-works/oltp-install-script/instawdb.sql

Derived here: `schema_extract.json` (table/column/type/description/key/foreign-key
transcription, produced by `eval/adventureworks/extract.py`) and the per-subject-area case
assets built from it. Table and column descriptions are reproduced VERBATIM from the upstream
`sp_addextendedproperty` statements; they are not authored, extended or paraphrased by this
project (WP30 §2.3).

